---
title: "service_lifecycle (Docker Deployment Configuration)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_build: build context = .
    q_build --> q_env_file: load env_file .env
    q_env_file --> q_env_override: set NODE_ENV = production
    q_env_override --> q_bind_port: bind 3000:3000
    q_bind_port --> q_start: start bot service
    q_start --> q_running: container healthy
    q_running --> q_stopped: manual stop
    q_running --> q_restart_check: container exited
    q_stopped --> [*]: unless-stopped policy, manual stop
    q_restart_check --> q_start: restart (unless-stopped)

    note right of q_env_file
        INV-001: .env file must exist at build context root
        INV-002: env_file values are loaded before environment overrides
    end note

    note right of q_env_override
        INV-003: NODE_ENV = production overrides any NODE_ENV in .env
    end note

    note right of q_bind_port
        INV-004: host port 3000 must not be already bound
    end note

    note right of q_restart_check
        INV-005: restart policy unless-stopped restarts on crash but not on manual docker stop
    end note
